Source: @DISTRO_ID@-speedtest
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Build-Depends:
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
 golang-go (>= 2:1.27~)
Standards-Version: 4.7.4
Homepage: https://github.com/omacom/omarchy-speedtest
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: @DISTRO_ID@-speedtest
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Built-Using: ${misc:Built-Using}
Description: network speed test client for the @DISTRO_NAME@ desktop
 Measures download or upload speed against speed.omarchy.org, the service
 Omarchy runs, and prints the running rate for the desktop's speed test panel.
